      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article presents a systematic review of the instruments measuring pain with patients suffering from cancer. A description of each instrument is provided followed by the presentation of the psychometric characteristics. The review is followed by a discussion on the relevancy of these instruments as well as their application in clinics."},
